// ── Wet streaks + rain-wet car ─ ImGui header "Wet / Rain", TOML table [wet_streaks] (L10.2, 2026-11-20) ── Debug-only.
// Lamp and car-light reflections on wet up-facing surfaces use an anisotropic GGX lobe stretched toward the viewer
// (packed into roofCount.yzw). car_rain_wet: a wet road also wets and beads the car's exterior, lamp lenses included.
TUNE_B(streakEnabled, "wet_streaks", "enabled", true, "Wet light streaks##streaks", NOREL)
